                        Balliol College (Domus de Balliolo)</orgName><p>‘On 5v is a pencil note:
                        Memorandum acomodasse tres pecias super librum Top. Laur. Cornub.; Laurence
                        of Cornwall appears as an Oxford Franciscan of the last third of the 13th
                        cent. in Little, GFO 212. At the head of 1 is an erased inscription: Ricardi
